# Auto-possessification is no longer applied to an iterator at the end of a
# capture group when the pattern contains any recursion, because what follows
# the group is not the same for its inline and its recursed use.
# ChangeLog 10.31 item 31.

/^(?<A>a+)b(?&A)a$/
    aaabaaa
    aba

/^(?<A>a+)b(?&A)a$/no_auto_possess
    aaabaaa

# Numbered subroutine calls are recursion for this purpose too.
/^(x+)y(?1)x$/
    xxxyxxx

